// Gateway reads permit only when the gateway's owner name is short. Under
// unconditional provider execution this provider ALSO runs on Bucket reads
// (where `resource.owner` resolves to Null and the defensive script
// returns its sentinel); the rule's `resource is Gateway` scope head means
// Cedar never lets it fire there — the Bucket verdicts are governed
// entirely by the other policy.
permit (
    principal,
    action == Drupe::Action::"Read",
    resource is Drupe::Gateway
)
when guardrails {
    Strings::Length(resource.owner).length < 6
};
